# M2: a document with a header and a footer; edit the footer, insert the file name field, and return to the document.
@copy headers.rtf
@open HEADERS.RTF
f10 right right right right right right enter       # Document > Header
end
f10 right enter                                      # Edit > Undo (nothing)
f10 right right right right right right down enter   # Document > Footer
end space
f10 right right down down down down enter           # Insert > File Name
f10 right right right right right right down down down down down enter   # Document > Return to Document
f10 down down down down down down down enter
n
